  "body": "Eleven Coates delivers elevated living with completion October 2026.\r\n\r\nEleven Coates is a rare opportunity to own one of five bespoke luxury homes, perfectly positioned above Hobson Bay with panoramic views to the city skyline. Nestled in Orakei’s prestigious Fenton Circus, this boutique development is crafted for discerning downsizers and professionals seeking design, comfort, and convenience.\r\n\r\nEach home features generous proportions, natural light, and timeless finishes. The high-spec kitchen showcases a natural stone benchtop with a breakfast island and Vidaspace oak joinery. Expansive open-plan living extends to a northeast-facing courtyard with lush landscaping and an outdoor fireplace—ideal for entertaining or unwinding.\r\n\r\nProperty Highlights:\r\n• 3 bedrooms, 2 bathrooms, powder room & separate laundry\r\n• 167m² (approx.) interior on 231m² land\r\n• Standalone, two-level design with private entrance\r\n• Brick cladding for strength and warmth\r\n• 2.7m ceilings throughout\r\n• Integrated HVAC & premium double glazing\r\n• Smart home tech with upgrade options available\r\n• Gated community with internal-access garage\r\n• Fully tiled bathrooms and premium natural finishes\r\n\r\nLocation highlights:\r\n• 1 min to Fenton Circus\r\n• 4 min to Orakei Marina & Ampersand Eatery\r\n• Steps to Coates Ave Village cafés, shops & services\r\n• Easy drive to Mission Bay, St. Heliers, Parnell & CBD\r\n\r\nDesigned by Bare Architecture, with over 40 years’ experience crafting bespoke homes.\r\n\r\nContact Carl Watkins: c.watkins@barfoot.co.nz - 021 424 736\r\n\r\nelevencoates.nz\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
